{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡県出身\n櫻坂46 大沼晶保です🐟🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobdXzMIP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobCueQqW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポニーと珍獣たち🐾🐾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今夜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "深夜24時15分から\nサクラミーツSPが放送です✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特番とっても嬉しいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美青ちゃんがゲストに来てくれました‎‎𖤐 ̖́-‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コロコロチキチキペッパーズさんとの\nプレッシャーミーツも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Aマッソ加納さん3時のヒロイン福田さんとの\n放課後トークも\nどちらも大盛り上がりでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひぜひご覧ください👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして9月10日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツのイベント\nサクラミーツフェスが開催されます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただいまチケット応募受付中で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸\n最速先行申込は23日(火)23：59まで\nそう明日までです！！！\n🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらちゃんの卒業セレモニーのある9月に\nサクラミーツイベントも開催できて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーターのみなさんときらちゃんと私たちで、とびきりの思い出が作れる機会があってとっても嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも応援してくださるみなさんのおかげです！本当にありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "積み重ねてきたサクラミーツらしさを大切にしながら、新しいことにも挑戦して\n9月という1年の後半ですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんに今年で1番笑った！\nと思っていただけるくらい笑顔にしたいです🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな大好ききらちゃんのやりたいことも詰め込んできらちゃんを素敵な形で送り出せるイベントになると思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新メンバーとしてなぎちゃんが入ってきてくれて、ゆーづとあいりちゃんと5人での最初で最後のイベントです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出来ることならミーター\n全員参加希望です✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろんサクラミーツ観たことないよ〜って方も大歓迎です！誰でも楽しんでいただけるような内容になっていると思います！これを機にミーター(サクラミーツ視聴者さん)に加入していただけるようにみんなで力を合わせて頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場も2倍のキャパということで\nパワーアップしているので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひぜひ会場に遊びに来てくださったら\n嬉しいです😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昼ミーツも夜ミーツも\nいつも全然違う内容となっているので\nどちらもぜひ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってるね〜🦖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://ticket.tv-asahi.co.jp/ex/project/sakurameets2026?_ga=2.172522212.639479151.1782127283-1313923584.1781235118"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日「STAR」さんにて「What's \"KAZOKU\"?」披露させていただきました🏠✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また披露できてとっても嬉しいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTed8dU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふわふわハーフツインにしたよ〜₍ᐢ.ˬ.ᐢ₎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobedC2c9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三つ編みも入ってるんだー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケット撮影の時のー！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob253ji5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNlCxi5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDQzVgK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobzXG0gf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobtAKLwj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたは190cm沼にはまりました"}], "source": "official"}